USE THE FILES FROM THE "COMPILED" FOLDER

* Extract the files from the .zip
* Launch Xbox 360 Neighborhood (or put extracted files on USB)
* Navigate to your MW3 game path (ie HDD > Games > MW3)
* Extract the raw folder to your game path. When done it should be: [MW3 Path] > raw > script.gscbin
* Extract the GSCLoader.xex to the root of your HDD
* Launch MW3 and load the .xex via a module loader (or set as a plugin)
* Then launch the game and the GSC will load whenever you start a match
